          Its edge weights, in minutes, are AB: 5; AC: 2; BC: 1; BD: 4; CD: 7;
          CE: 9; DE: 2; DF: 6; EF: 3; FG: 2; and EG: 7. There are no other edges.
          The drawing is not to scale.</p>
